## Terms & Agreements

These Terms & Agreements outline the policies and boundaries that support my work and protect the integrity of your experience. By booking any session, class, or event, you agree to the following.

---

## Client Disclaimer

Spiritual readings, mentorship, mediumship, and intuitive guidance are for personal insight and empowerment only. By booking, you acknowledge that:

- These services are not a substitute for medical, legal, financial, or psychological advice.
- Any decisions you make based on a session are your responsibility.
- Outcomes, predictions, and intuitive impressions are not guaranteed.
- You are booking energetic and spiritual guidance, not a result-based product.
- You are 18 years or older, or have parental consent.

---

## Confidentiality Policy

All sessions are confidential. Your personal information, session details, and sensitive topics will not be shared without your explicit written permission.

---

## Mediumship Confidentiality

Mediumship sessions are held with heightened confidentiality. Names, memories, and messages from loved ones in spirit will not be shared without your consent.

---

## No-Refund Policy

All sales are final. Refunds are not offered for any reason.

**Rescheduling:** You may reschedule once with at least 24 hours’ notice.  
**Cancellations:** Payments are non-refundable.  
**Late Arrivals:** Arrivals more than 15 minutes late are considered a no-show.  
**Emergency Exceptions:** Genuine emergencies may qualify for a one-time reschedule.  
**Chargeback Protection:** Chargebacks for completed or missed sessions may result in removal from future bookings.

---

## Event & Class Policy

All event and class bookings are final.

**Attendance:** Please arrive on time.  
**Transfers:** You may request to transfer your spot if allowed.  
**Rescheduling:** Group events cannot be rescheduled.  
**Cancellations:** If I must cancel, you will receive a new date or credit.  
**Conduct:** Disruptive behavior may result in removal without refund.

---

## Recording Release & Content Use Agreement

**Consent to Record:** Recording is optional and only done with your explicit consent.

**Usage Options:**  
- Personal use only  
- Anonymous use  
- Partial use  
- Full use  
- No recording

**Model Release:** If you consent, your likeness may be used in marketing or educational content. No financial compensation is provided.

**Confidentiality:** Sensitive information and mediumship details will never be shared without permission.

**Ownership:** All recordings remain the intellectual property of my business.

**Revoking Consent:** You may withdraw consent before content is published.

**Agreement:** By participating in a recorded session, you agree to these terms.

